<title>UK: TENNIS-BRITAIN AND ZIMBABWE LEVEL 1-1 IN DAVIS CUP TIE.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-BRITAIN AND ZIMBABWE LEVEL 1-1 IN DAVIS CUP TIE.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Britain and Zimbabwe were level</p>
<p>1-1 after the opening singles in their Davis Cup Euro/African</p>
<p>zone group one second round match on Friday.</p>
<p>Results (British names first):</p>
<p>Jamie Delgado lost to Wayne Black 6-2 3-6 1-6 3-6</p>
<p>Andrew Richardson beat Byron Black 3-6 6-4 1-6 6-4 6-4</p>
</text>
